{title: Kyun Utthe Dil Chhod Aaye}
{artist: Javed Ali Uttam Singh Tv Serial Title}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]OOoooooooo,        [G]Le Aankhaan Rakh Le Girvee [Bm]
[G]Deewani Hai Ye Teri [Bm],        Churake [Em]Tujhse Nazre [Bm]
[G]Tujhe Dekha Karengi,        [G]Ye Kya Deewanagi Hai
[G]Kyun Mera Dil [D]Shor [G]Paaye,        [G]Ye Kya Mujhko Hua Hai
[G]Kyun Utthe Dil [D]Chhod [G]Aaye,        [G]Kyun Utthe Dil [D]Chhod [G]Aaye
[G]Woh Mere Rubaroo Hai [Bm],        [G]Meri Chaahat Ka Chaandan [Bm]
Bani Main [Em]Heer Uski [Bm],        [G]Woh Mere Mann Ka Raanjhan
[G]Ye Rasme Aashiqui Hai,        [G]Koi Kai [D]se [G]Nibhaye
[G]Woh Chup Hai Sir Jhukaaye,        [G]Kyun Utthe Dil [D]Chhod [G]Aaye
[G]Kyun Utthe Dil [D]Chhod [G]Aaye,        [G]Kyun Pyaasi Zindadi Hai [Bm]
[G]Kyun Pyaase Nain Mere [Bm],        Kadde Te [Em]Aa [Bm]Sohneya
[G]Jiya Bechain Mere,        [G]Mai Dekhoon Raah Teri
[G]Tu Aake [D]Bhi Na [G]Aaye,        [G]Mujhe Tu Kyun Sataaye
[G]Kyun Utthe Dil [D]Chhod [G]Aaye,        [G]Kyun Utthe Dil [D]Chhod [G]Aaye
[G]Tu Mere Kol Aaja [Bm],        [G]Ya Mainu Tu Bulaale [Bm]
Ye Rang-e- [Em]Roop Mera [Bm],        [G]Tu Chupke Se Churaale
[G]Muje Apna Banaake,        [G]Huye Tum [D]Kyun [G]Paraaye
[G]Ae Yara Tum [D]Na [G]Aaye,        [G]Kyun Utthe Dil [D]Chhod [G]Aaye
